  "reasoning": "The defendants sold and used a pseudo‑base‑station to transmit large numbers of fraudulent SMS messages that impersonated banks and lured recipients to call a phone number, constituting fraud. Their conduct also involved the illegal acquisition and use of public telecommunication facilities (the pseudo‑base‑station), which is punishable under the crime of illegal acquisition, provision, or use of public telecommunication facilities. Therefore the appropriate charges are fraud and illegal use of public telecommunication facilities.",
